		(at 130.8 114.3)
		(descr "Ai-Thinker Ra-02 on the blue 2x8 2.54 mm adapter board (20.26 x 28.3 mm, rows 25.4 mm apart), mounted module-up on female headers. Courtyard covers only the header strips so low parts can sit underneath. Pad numbers match the Ra-02 symbol: bottom row 1-8 = GND GND 3V3 RST DIO0 DIO1 DIO2 DIO3, top row 9-16 right to left = GND DIO4 DIO5 SCK MISO MOSI NSS GND.")
